## 33. DEV SERVICES (ZERO-CONFIG TESTCONTAINERS)

Quarkus automatically starts containers for databases, Kafka, etc. in dev/test mode.

**How it works:** If no database URL is configured for dev/test, Quarkus will:
1. Detect the database extension (e.g., `quarkus-jdbc-postgresql`)
2. Start a PostgreSQL container using Testcontainers
